  "notes": [
   "Overall shape agrees with the CC BY 3D skull 170753 (overlay: mech1974_fig5_vs_3d_skulls_overlay.png).",
   "The drawing has a lower forehead (frontal profile about 0.03-0.04 CBL lower than the 3D skulls) and its cheek-tooth crowns sit about 0.03 CBL lower; total skull height above prosthion 0.345 vs 0.36 (170753).",
   "Mandible condyle-infradentale 0.78 CBL vs 0.77 (170753) and 0.79 (170555); ZB/CBL 0.55 vs 0.58 / 0.62 and wolf.yaml 0.56.",
   "Articulating the separately drawn mandible at the 3D hinge leaves its incisors about 0.03 CBL ahead of the prosthion: the redrawn mandible is about 3-4 % long relative to the skull, or the hinge sits further back than read."
  ]
